          {
            "title": "Multiple values 2",
            "id": 53486,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wypróbuj samodzielnie: policz elementy w tablicy <code>tasks</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dusting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;laundry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(tasks.length);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"howMany\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>tasks</code>, następnie <code>.</code> i na końcu <code>length</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zapisz liczbę zadań w zmiennej <code>howMany</code>, a następnie wyświetl tę liczbę.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"tasks\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;dusting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;laundry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"howMany\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"tasks\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"length\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"howMany\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"size\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tasks[0]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;howMany&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>tasks</code>, następnie <code>length</code> i na końcu <code>howMany</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "No values 1",
            "id": 52870,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nawet jeśli tablica <code>tasks</code> jest pusta, <code>tasks.length</code> podaje nam liczbę zawartych w niej elementów.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(tasks.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "No values 2",
            "id": 53487,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przechowaj pustą tablicę w <code>tasks</code>, aby zobaczyć, że jej długość wynosi <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(tasks.length);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[</code>, a następnie <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zapisz pustą tablicę w zmiennej <code>tasks</code>, aby jej długość wynosiła <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(tasks.length);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"size\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[</code>, następnie <code>]</code> i na końcu <code>length</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "If 1",
            "id": 52871,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy użyć długości tablicy do tworzenia <strong>instrukcji warunkowych</strong> zależnych od liczby jej elementów.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (tasks.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ugh, more work!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Ugh, more work!\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "If 2",
            "id": 52872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Spróbuj: wyświetl komunikat tylko wtedy, gdy <code>tasks.length</code> jest większe niż <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (tasks.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ugh, more work!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Ugh, more work!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>tasks.length</code>, następnie <code>&gt;</code> i na końcu <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl <code>Ugh, more work!</code> tylko wtedy, gdy tablica zawiera co najmniej jedno zadanie. Porównaj jej długość po lewej stronie z zerem.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;windows&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vacuum&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (tasks.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ugh, more work!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Ugh, more work!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>tasks.length</code>, następnie <code>&gt;</code> i na końcu <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 52873,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy także użyć długości tablicy, aby utworzyć <strong>pętle for</strong>, które przechodzą przez wszystkie jej elementy.</p><p>W tym celu powtarzamy pętlę tyle razy, ile elementów znajduje się w tablicy, używając właściwości <code>length</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Eve&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; friends.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Ana\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Eve\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Sam\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Two executions",
            "id": 52874,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Powtórz pętlę for dwa razy, określając, że wartość <code>i</code> musi być mniejsza niż <code>length</code> tablicy.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; friends.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(friends[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Anna\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Tim\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i &lt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
